From 1aceb560364faa8d8645e16e031568712e0f3052 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BearddOddity <beardedoddity@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 07:40:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] Beardd's Wayfarer 1.2.1: the waypoint says the distance
 alone (the player: the seconds and minutes are "irrelevant")

distLabel(d) is the distance; the pace the time was read from is no longer kept.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
